651 0 obj
<<
/AP <<
/N 1729 0 R
>>
/C [1 1 0]
/CA 0.964996
/Contents (This means that if we perform addition of 4-bit numbers \(4-bit magnitude n 5th bit for sign\) and both numbers have their MSBs as '1' then an overflow will occur....coz the result magnitude is now of 5-bits and an additional 6th bit is required to indicate its sign which we don't have.)
/CreationDate (D:20101016170425+05'30')
/F 28
/M (D:20101016171451+05'30')
/NM (692f3fb3-1726-4556-ab2e-cc1880c69a06)
/Name /Comment
/P 70 0 R
/Popup 652 0 R
/RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:9.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">This means that if we perform addition of 4-bit numbers \(4-bit magnitude n 5th bit for sign\) and both numbers have their MSBs as '1' then an overflow will occur....coz the result magnitude is now of 5-bits and an additional 6th bit is required to indicate its sign which we don't have.</span></p></body>)
/Rect [96.0584 220.349 116.058 238.349]
/Subj (Note)
/Subtype /Text
/T (Aman Vats)
/Type /Annot
>>
endobj
