/Popup 1201 0 R
/RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:9.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">FOR +ve edge triggered clock, &#13;The output \(Q or Q'\) which we apply as the clock will give will give DOWN counting and the other \(Q' or Q\) will give UP counting.&#13;&#13;FOR -ve edge triggered clock, &#13;The output \(Q or Q'\) which we apply as the clock will give will give UP counting and the other \(Q' or Q\) will give DOWN counting.&#13;</span></p></body>)
/Rect [87.8068 517.623 107.807 535.623]
/Subj (Sticky Note)
/Subtype /Text
/T (Aman Vats)
/Type /Annot
>>
