>>
/C [1 1 0]
/Contents <>
/CreationDate (D:20101022152135+05'30')
/F 28
/M (D:20101225171921+05'30')
/NM (d5f7ddc6-a0d1-4041-a837-8e062e417754)
/Name /Comment
/P 328 0 R
/Popup 1203 0 R
/RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:9.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">\(I\) Q applied as +ve edge triggered clock :-&#13;    If counts are taken from Q outputs then DOWN counter.&#13;    If taken from Q' outputs then UP counter. &#13;&#13;\(II\) Q applied as -ve edge triggered clock :-&#13;    If counts are taken from Q outputs then UP counter.&#13;    If taken from Q' outputs then DOWN counter. &#13;&#13;\(III\) Q' applied as +ve edge triggered clock :-&#13;    If counts are taken from Q outputs then UP counter.&#13;    If taken from Q' outputs then DOWN counter. &#13;&#13;\(IV\) Q' applied as -ve edge triggered clock :-&#13;    If counts are taken from Q outputs then DOWN counter.&#13;    If taken from Q' outputs then UP counter.</span></p></body>)
/Rect [77.1805 468.13 97.1805 486.13]
